Cumbria Resileince Forum - Storm Fenella - SITREP 11
Time of report: 16/01/2026 1700

1. SITUATION
Incident status: RECOVERY
Properties flooded: approx. 340 (unconfirmed).

2. SITES AND ROUTES
- A591 Thirlmere: CLOSED
- Riverside Community Centre: rest centre closed (run by Cumberland Council)
- Northside Bridge: closed as a precaution
- the Pooley Bridge crossing: reopened
- Glenridding village hall: rest centre closed
- Fellside Care Home: evacuated
- Keswick School: stood down (run by Cumberland Council)
- Cockermouth School: rest centre OPEN (run by Cumberland Council)

3. AGENCIES RESPONDING
National Highways, EA, NCIC

